<title>USA: Papa John's names Blaine Hurst president.</title>
<headline>Papa John's names Blaine Hurst president.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Papa John's International Inc said Monday it had named Blaine Hurst as president of the company.  </p>
<p>Hurst was executive vice president and chief administrative officer of the company before taking on the new post, it said.</p>
<p>It did not say who he would replace and company officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Papa John's operates and franchises pizza delivery and carry-out restaurants.</p>
